<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim March ind output down 8.6 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim March ind output down 8.6 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output in March fell by a preliminary 8.6 percent month-on-month, and rose 3.6 percent year-on-year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>     (Pct change)   March 1997    Feb 1996    March 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month	-8.6	     +2.4	 -6.2</p>
<p> Year-on-year	  +3.6	     +6.8	 -1.6</p>
<p>NOTE: KSH said industrial output was up 5.4 percent in the first quarter of 1997 on a year-on-year basis.</p>
<p>KSH said final figures would be released on May 14.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
